号下？** 当前设计是 HALEI 个人飞书（user token），这样 HALEI 打开飞书任务 app 直接看到。你确认？\n\n2. **tts 两条 cron 膨胀超 1.6KB**：你是接受压缩到 ~200 chars 同步指令（功能不变），还是接受超一点（比如 1.8KB），还是要我另想办法？\n\n3. **其余 6 个 agent 暂无 cron**：这些是未来会有还是本来就不需要？对于暂无 cron 的 agent，清单还建不建？\n\n---\n\n**预计总工时：M1 讨论确认 10min + M2 试点 45min + M3 全量 90min = ~2.5h**\n\n方案已出，等你拍板后动手。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":5907,"output":2332,"cacheRead":95201,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103440,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783086792697,"responseId":"0696f1c9e98a37db9c4bedff0efc3d32","responseModel":"MiniMax-M2.7"}}
